  <metadata>
    <name>Amsterdam → Zandvoort beach</name>
    <desc>Sample cycling activity for the Activity Tracker demo. 22.9 km from Amsterdam Sloterdijk to the Zandvoort beachfront at ~18 km/h average. The track follows the real cycle network: the geometry was snapped with the TomTom Routing API (travelMode=bicycle), and heart rate, elevation and timestamps are laid over it.</desc>
